cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these workflows, scripts or tables, please cite the article below."
title: "Workflows, scripts and analysis tables for the genomic characterization of Enterobacter chengduensis from a Tanzanian hospital"
abstract: >-
  Workflow configurations, parameters, accessions and analysis scripts for the
  comparative genomic analysis of Enterobacter chengduensis isolates recovered
  from a patient and from a hospital environmental surface in an orthopaedic
  ward in Mwanza, Tanzania, set against publicly deposited genomes of the
  species.
